    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "title": "Proverbs 6",
      "startLine": 1,
      "endLine": 1,
      "startPage": 124,
      "endPage": 144,
      "subtitles": []
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 8,
      "title": "Proverbs 7",
      "startLine": 1,
      "endLine": 1,
      "startPage": 145,
      "endPage": 171,
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "title": "Or have given a handshake for a stranger,",
          "pageNumber": 145,
          "lineNumber": 3
        },
        {
          "title": "Or caught by the words of your mouth,",
          "pageNumber": 145,
          "lineNumber": 5
        },
        {
          "title": "Nor slumber to your eyelids;",
          "pageNumber": 145,
          "lineNumber": 10
        },
        {
          "title": "Observe her ways and be wise,",
          "pageNumber": 150,
          "lineNumber": 3
        },
        {
          "title": "Officer or ruler,",
          "pageNumber": 150,
          "lineNumber": 5
        },
        {
          "title": "When will you arise from your sleep?",
          "pageNumber": 150,
          "lineNumber": 9
        },
        {
          "title": "A little folding of the hands to rest\"-",
          "pageNumber": 150,
          "lineNumber": 11
        },
        {
          "title": "Yes, seven which are an abomination to Him:",
          "pageNumber": 156,
          "lineNumber": 3
        },
        {
          "title": "And hands that shed innocent blood,",
          "pageNumber": 156,
          "lineNumber": 5
        },
        {
          "title": "Feet that run rapidly to evil,",
          "pageNumber": 156,
          "lineNumber": 7
        },
        {
          "title": "And do not forsake the teaching of your mother;",
          "pageNumber": 161,
          "lineNumber": 3
        },
        {
          "title": "And his clothes not be burned?",
          "pageNumber": 168,
          "lineNumber": 4
        },
        {
          "title": "And his feet not be scorched?",
          "pageNumber": 168,
          "lineNumber": 6
        },
        {
          "title": "To satisfy himself when he is hungry;",
          "pageNumber": 169,
          "lineNumber": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 9,
      "title": "Proverbs 8",
      "startLine": 1,
      "endLine": 1,
      "startPage": 172,
      "endPage": 186,
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "title": "And call understanding your intimate friend;",
          "pageNumber": 172,
          "lineNumber": 9
        },
        {
          "title": "I looked out through my lattice,",
          "pageNumber": 174,
          "lineNumber": 3
        },
        {
          "title": "A young man lacking sense,",
          "pageNumber": 174,
          "lineNumber": 6
        },
        {
          "title": "And he takes the way to her house,",
          "pageNumber": 174,
          "lineNumber": 8
        },
        {
          "title": "Her feet do not remain at home;",
          "pageNumber": 175,
          "lineNumber": 5
        },
        {
          "title": "And with a brazen face she says to him:",
          "pageNumber": 175,
          "lineNumber": 9
        },
        {
          "title": "He has gone on a long journey;",
          "pageNumber": 175,
          "lineNumber": 21
        },
        {
          "title": "At the full moon he will come home.\"",
          "pageNumber": 175,
          "lineNumber": 23
        },
        {
          "title": "Or as one in fetters to the discipline of a fool,",
          "pageNumber": 175,
          "lineNumber": 28
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "title": "Proverbs 9",
      "startLine": 1,
      "endLine": 1,
      "startPage": 187,
      "endPage": 202,
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "title": "And understanding lift up her voice?",
          "pageNumber": 187,
          "lineNumber": 3
        },
        {
          "title": "Where the paths meet, she takes her stand;",
          "pageNumber": 187,
          "lineNumber": 5
        },
        {
          "title": "At the entrance of the doors, she cries out:",
          "pageNumber": 187,
          "lineNumber": 7
        },
        {
          "title": "In the midst of the paths of justice,",
          "pageNumber": 192,
          "lineNumber": 8
        },
        {
          "title": "Before the hills I was brought forth;",
          "pageNumber": 193,
          "lineNumber": 11
        },
        {
          "title": "When He inscribed a circle on the face of the deep,",
          "pageNumber": 194,
          "lineNumber": 4
        },
        {
          "title": "When the springs of the deep became fixed,",
          "pageNumber": 194,
          "lineNumber": 6
        },
        {
          "title": "When He marked out the foundations of the earth;",
          "pageNumber": 194,
          "lineNumber": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "title": "Proverbs 10",
      "startLine": 1,
      "endLine": 1,
      "startPage": 203,
      "endPage": 221,
      "subtitles": [
        {
          "title": "She has also set her table;",
          "pageNumber": 206,
          "lineNumber": 5
        },
        {
          "title": "From the tops of the heights of the city:",
          "pageNumber": 206,
          "lineNumber": 7
        },
        {
          "title": "To him who lacks understanding she says,",
          "pageNumber": 207,
          "lineNumber": 3
        },
        {
          "title": "On a seat by the high places of the city,",
          "pageNumber": 215,
          "lineNumber": 9
        },
        {
          "title": "Who are making their paths straight:",
          "pageNumber": 215,
          "lineNumber": 11
        },
        {
          "title": "And to him who lacks understanding she says,",
          "pageNumber": 215,
          "lineNumber": 13
        },
        {
          "title": "And bread eaten in secret is pleasant.\"",
          "pageNumber": 215,
          "lineNumber": 15
        }
      ]
    },
